title: "Agent-Based Model of Infectious Disease Transmission on Cruise Ships"

abstract: "R scripts, model inputs, scenario parameters, processed datasets, calibration data, and simulation outputs for an agent-based model of infectious disease transmission and public health interventions on cruise ships."

